      "courseId": "course-os",
      "knowledgePointId": "kp-deadlock",
      "objectiveId": "deadlock-prevention-condition",
      "stage": "practice",
      "prompt": "四个死锁必要条件必须同时成立。预防死锁的一般做法是什么？",
